{"version":1,"content":"<p>據路透社2026年11月12日報道，美國代理司法部長Todd Blanche當天表示，美國司法部尚未就中國商人Alice Huang是否為中國間諜作出結論。此前媒體報道稱，美國情報部門懷疑Alice Huang受中國政府指使，可能通過與英偉達創始人黃仁勳的私人關係獲取敏感信息。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586150.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T23:44:22.710538+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T23:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T23:37:36.112622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T23:37:36.112622+00:00","content_hash":"ef4ae6e2de2b71cd9da81078970deccc9b2344eaf07a8b0fd0dc6458086f6482","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}